# ID: DSA-123
# Category: misc
# Algorithm: runtime error: end of input while reading (P10)
# Exercises: reading more ints than supplied, sum printed only on success
# Difficulty: easy
# Expected: running sums of the available numbers, then runtime error "invalid input", exit 1
int s
s lo 0 pettu
prati i 0 nundi 5 varaku {
    int v
    v ni chaduvu
    s lo s + v pettu
    s ni chupi
}
